        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86467, Traditional Overland Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Overland Knob is made by Emtek so you can be assured it encompasses all the beauty and attention to quality for which Emtek is known. The Overland Cabinet Knob is available in 2 sizes and an array of stunning finish color options. Each knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware. The Emtek Overland Knob is great for use on kitchen cabinets, in the bathroom, or on furniture.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86467-specifications.gif?v=1718159564\" width=\"600\" height=\"127\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86467 specifications\">\r\n</p><p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Traditional Overland Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>86467: Small</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86468: Large</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
